"EVALSHA" {:fn-name "evalsha", :cluster-key-idx 1, :fn-params-more [sha1 numkeys & args], :fn-params-fixed [sha1 numkeys], :req-args-fixed ["EVALSHA" sha1 numkeys], :fn-docstring "`EVALSHA` Redis command.\n\nExecutes a server-side Lua script by SHA1 digest.\n\nSince Redis 2.6.0. Complexity: Depends on the script that is executed.\n\nReference: https://redis.io/commands/evalsha/"}
