"HELLO" {:fn-name "hello", :cluster-key-idx 1, :fn-params-more [& args], :fn-params-fixed [], :req-args-fixed ["HELLO"], :fn-docstring "`HELLO` Redis command.\n\nHandshakes with the Redis server.\n\nSince Redis 6.0.0. Complexity: O(1).\n\nReference: https://redis.io/commands/hello/"}
