"KEYS" {:fn-name "keys", :cluster-key-idx 1, :fn-params-more nil, :fn-params-fixed [pattern], :req-args-fixed ["KEYS" pattern], :fn-docstring "`KEYS` Redis command.\n\nReturns all key names that match a pattern.\n\nSince Redis 1.0.0. Complexity: O(N) with N being the number of keys in the database, under the assumption that the key names in the database and the given pattern have limited length.\n\nReference: https://redis.io/commands/keys/"}
