"LATENCY" {:fn-name "latency", :cluster-key-idx 1, :fn-params-more [arg1 & args], :fn-params-fixed [arg1], :req-args-fixed ["LATENCY" arg1], :fn-docstring "`LATENCY` Redis command.\n\nA container for latency diagnostics commands.\n\nSince Redis 2.8.13. Complexity: Depends on subcommand.\n\nReference: https://redis.io/commands/latency/"}
